  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your bifurcated mind is difficult for others to penetrate.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Exile’s Path<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You think simultaneously in Common and Elven, so attempts to read your mind automatically fail unless the creature reading your mind is able to understand both Common and Elven. You can use this feat to reroll any Will save, not only against enchantment effects, and you can use this feat more than once per day by expending one use of mythic power for each use after the first.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc123\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
